{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52933","headline":"奉和行幸诗 · 苗晋卿","name":"奉和行幸诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"接仗风云动，迎军鸟兽舞。\n（均见清赵殿成《王右丞集笺注》卷二十二《魏郡太守河北采访处置使上党苗八德政碑》、《吟窗杂录》卷二六《历代吟谱》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苗晋卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}